	(text "PWR-002: upstream regulator / reset voltage budget\nTPS63802 candidate: +/-1% feedback applies in PWM mode.\nExample 56k/10k, 0.1%, 25 ppm/C; deltaT=100 C.\nVout = Vfb*(1+Rt/Rb) + Ib*Rt; allocate +/-100 nA.\nPWM static screen: 3.242044..3.358485 V.\nRadio: 3.242044 - 0.5 A*0.175 ohm = 3.154544 V.\nAbove U6 RADIO-014 rising screen: 14.923 mV remains.\nMCU reset release headroom: 48.093 mV.\nNot a transient guarantee; regulator circuit not fitted.\nMath: ../design/power_decoupling.md (PWR-002)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.7 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/power_decoupling.md#pwr-002-main-rail-regulation-and-reset-headroom")
		)
		(uuid "1e311763-baef-42a6-83aa-c305d9e30b3d")
	)
	(text "RADIO-013: R11 / C6_EN reset pull-up\n10k 1%, 100ppm/C; deltaT=100 C allocation.\nRmin/max=10k*(1 +/-1%)*(1 +/-1%)=9801/10201 ohm.\nAllocate +/-12uA total adverse node leakage.\nIsink <=3.6/9801+12uA=0.379310mA <0.4mA.\nU6 VOL<=0.25V at 0.4mA, VDD>=1.5V.\nAt C6 table point 3.3V, 25 C:\nVEN>=3.3-12uA*10201=3.177588V >2.475V VIH.\nVIL=0.825V; low margin=0.825-0.25=0.575V.\nPmax=3.6^2/9801=1.322314mW.\nMR arbitration, power states and timing remain open.\nMath: ../design/radio_interface.md (RADIO-013)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 317.5 185.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-013-reset-output-and-module-enable-pull-up")
		)
		(uuid "2fdd2c9d-c4d2-41f1-abba-69e229915ff5")
	)
	(text "RADIO-009: U5 isolates host and switched-radio signal domains.\nC49/C50: 100 nF local bypass; TI TXU0304 section 12.1.\nC50 adds 0.1 uF: fitted external radio capacitance = 10.2 uF nominal.\n5 MHz budget: 100 - 11 - 11 = 78 ns remaining (5 pF test load).\nSPI/OE and reset qualification remain open; timing is not closed.\nMath: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-009-spi-power-domain-isolation"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 124.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-009-spi-power-domain-isolation")
		)
		(uuid "65624b99-0e43-4086-bb29-811c3a766cfa")
	)
	(text "RADIO-004: U4 TPS22917DBVT / radio power gating\nQOD tied to VOUT: Rdis = 150 ohm TYPICAL.\nC45+C46+C50 = 0.1+10+0.1 = 10.2 uF nominal external load.\nt90..10 = ln(9)*150*10.2u = 3.362 ms (ideal RC).\nNot a guaranteed off-time: module C/load and VIN decay matter.\nC48 connects CT to VIN, not GND; 50 V rating >=7 V required.\nReset/isolation and upstream regulator remain incomplete.\nLoad update: RADIO-009; device limits: RADIO-004.\nMath: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-009-spi-power-domain-isolation"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 187.96 154.432 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-009-spi-power-domain-isolation")
		)
		(uuid "6ee9ae5e-64a4-457a-b04f-1c82cf26dbc0")
	)
	(text "RADIO-003: C46 bulk bypass / TDK C3216X7R1V106K160AC\n10 uF nominal, +/-10%, X7R; DC bias reduces capacitance.\nC(3.3 V) = 9.69875 + (3.3-3.15)/0.85*(9.38950-9.69875)\n             = 9.64418 uF; C(3.6 V) = 9.53503 uF (nominal).\nSource curve interpolation, NOT a guaranteed minimum.\nRail: 3.0..3.6 V; source capability >= 0.5 A.\nSupply and transmit transient qualification remain required.\nCalculations: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-003-bulk-capacitance"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.446 93.726 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-003-bulk-capacitance")
		)
		(uuid "73b39401-7019-496b-9457-6f1577917331")
	)
	(text "RADIO-010: R9/R10 idle-state bias, 10k 1%\nRmin/max = 10k*(1 +/-1%)*(1 +/-1%) = 9801/10201 ohm.\n12 uA adverse leakage is an ALLOCATION, not measured.\nR9: Vlow = 12u*10201 = 0.122412 V.\nTI VT- min = 0.17 V at the 1.1 V equal-rail test point.\nR10 @3.3 V: VCS >=3.177588 V > VIH 2.475 V (25 C).\nR9 enabled current = 3.3/10k = 0.330 mA.\nR10 draws similar current only while CS is low.\nOE arbitration, all-state leakage and timing remain open.\nMath: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-010-idle-state-bias"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-010-idle-state-bias")
		)
		(uuid "75b4af6d-5689-4dd7-8c8a-06293f9ec382")
	)
	(text "RADIO-015: U7 Schmitt-input reset arbitration\nIN1=GND: Y = MCU_RESET_N AND RADIO_RESET_REQ_N.\nEither low asserts U6 MR; C53 = 100nF MCU-rail bypass.\nR14: Rmin/max=10k*(1 +/-1%)*(1 +/-1%)=9801/10201 ohm.\n12uA adverse-current ALLOCATION: Vlow <= 0.122412 V.\nAt U7 3V test point: VT-_min-Vlow = 0.717588 V.\nAt 3.6V: I_R14 <= 0.367309 mA; P <= 1.322314 mW.\nIf |I_U7out|<=100uA: MR low/high margins >=0.65/0.8V\non shared 3.0-3.6V rail. MR load bound NOT yet verified.\nParent reset wiring, full-rail thresholds and sequencing open.\nMath: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-015-reset-request-arbitration"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-015-reset-request-arbitration")
		)
		(uuid "80fa67e3-4738-46a7-8272-d6dc5e749f56")
	)
	(text "RADIO-005: C47 / U4 VIN local bypass\n10 uF nominal, +/-10%, 35 V X7R; same exact TDK part as C46.\nC(3.3 V) = 9.69875 + (3.3-3.15)/0.85*(9.38950-9.69875)\n             = 9.64418 uF nominal; NOT a guaranteed minimum.\nDroop = integral(Iload-Isource)dt / Ceff + ESR/ESL effects.\nTI section 11: 1 uF usually sufficient; slow sources may need more.\nC47 is upstream: exclude it from C45+C46 output-discharge math.\nRegulator/transient qualification required; no source flag added.\nCalculations: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-005-input-bypass"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.46 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-005-input-bypass")
		)
		(uuid "8ba59534-1ba2-416f-9640-73339628a0f6")
	)
	(text "RADIO-007: C48 / CT slew-rate control, TDK C1608NP01H102J080AA\n1nF +/-5%, 50 V NP0; CT-to-VIN, NOT CT-to-GND.\nTI 3.6 V / 25 C TYPICAL table point, not guaranteed at 3.3 V:\nSlew = 1900/1000 = 1.9 mV/us; tON = 3.8*1000 = 3.8 ms.\ntR(10..90%) = 1.6*1000 = 1.6 ms (TI test load).\nC45+C46+C50 = 10.2 uF: Icap = C*dV/dt = 19.38 mA.\nOpen-CT comparison: 10.2u*44mV/us = 448.8 mA (typical).\nTotal inrush also includes module C/load and future rail parts.\nNot a current limiter or reset delay; startup qualification required.\nTiming model: RADIO-007; updated load: RADIO-009.\nFull math: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-009-spi-power-domain-isolation"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 228.6 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-009-spi-power-domain-isolation")
		)
		(uuid "a3b0d9cd-be71-4d46-b834-9a684f501730")
	)
	(text "RADIO-006: R7/R8 / active-high enable, default OFF\nR7 series = R8 pulldown = 10k 1%; +/-2% screening envelope.\nTPS22917 ON: low <=0.35 V; high >=1.0 V.\nAssume node leakage <=10 uA and host VOL<=0.5 V, VOH>=2.5 V.\nRparallel <=5.1k; divider fraction = 0.49..0.51.\nVlow <=0.5*0.51+10u*5.1k = 0.306 V <0.35 V.\nVhigh >=2.5*0.49-10u*5.1k = 1.174 V >1.0 V.\nHi-Z screen: 10u*10.2k = 0.102 V; disable host pull-up.\nHost pin, all power states, leakage and timing need qualification.\nFull math: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-006-enable-divider"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 228.6 185.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-006-enable-divider")
		)
		(uuid "b3fe64c9-81e0-47c7-9dd2-5988e0a7a95a")
	)
	(text "RADIO-014: R12/R13 switched-radio sense divider\n33.2k / 20k; Susumu RG, 0.1%, 25ppm/C.\nAllocate deltaT=100 C, 0.15% drift, +/-150nA total.\nfmin/max=(1 +/-0.001)*(1 +/-0.0025)*(1 +/-0.0015)\n          = 0.99500774625 / 1.00500775375.\nVtrip = Vsense*(1+Rt/Rb) + Is*Rt.\nVfall >=1.15*0.99*(1+Rtmin/Rbmax)-150nA*Rtmax\n      = 3.004600 V; margin above 3V only 4.600mV.\nVrise <=1.15*1.01*1.00825*(1+Rtmax/Rbmin)\n        +150nA*Rtmax = 3.139622 V.\nPWR-002 release headroom: 14.923mV, static only.\nIdiv_nom=3.3/53.2k=62.030uA; each P <0.652mW.\nMR arbitration and brownout dynamics remain open.\nMath: ../design/radio_interface.md (RADIO-014)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.7 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-014-switched-radio-sense-divider")
		)
		(uuid "c87b6eaf-8d4f-4da0-88a2-efff6aae0d55")
	)
	(text "RADIO-012: C52 / U6 reset-release delay\nC52 = 1nF +/-5% NP0, CT to GND (not VIN).\nAt 100 C excursion, +/-30 ppm/C: 947.15..1053.15 pF.\ntnom = 1nF*1.23V/1.15uA + 25us = 1.094565 ms.\nAllocate +/-10nA external CT leakage; start discharged.\ntcharge_min = 947.15pF*1.17V/1.36uA = 814.828 us.\ntcharge_max = 1053.15pF*1.29V/0.89uA = 1526.476 us.\nCharge-only screen, NOT total reset min/max limits.\nC6 requires 50us stable supply and 50us reset low.\nComplete reset sequencing remains open.\nMath: ../design/radio_interface.md#radio-012-supervisor-reset-release-delay"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.7 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/radio_interface.md#radio-012-supervisor-reset-release-delay")
		)
		(uuid "ef90dbfa-f81a-4b92-b0a7-0c26bdde4289")
	)
